#  EventTix — AI-Powered Event Management Platform

**EventTix** is an intelligent Event Management System built with **NestJS**, **TypeScript**, and **Node.js**.

The platform combines traditional event management capabilities with **Large Language Models (LLMs)** and **Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG)** to provide intelligent, context-aware answers based on real event data.

Instead of manually searching through events, users can ask natural-language questions such as:

> “What is the nearest upcoming event?”

> “What events are happening next week?”

> “Are there any events this weekend?”

The system retrieves relevant event information, builds contextual data for the LLM, and generates accurate responses grounded in the available event data.

