#  AI & RAG Architecture

EventTix uses a Retrieval-Augmented Generation approach to improve the accuracy of AI-generated responses.

Instead of allowing the LLM to answer only from its general knowledge, EventTix provides event data as context.

## RAG Workflow

```text
User Question
      ↓
Retrieve Relevant Events
      ↓
Build Event Context
      ↓
Combine Context + User Question
      ↓
Send Prompt to LLM
      ↓
Generate Context-Aware Response
      ↓
Return Answer
```

### Why RAG?

RAG helps the system:

- Ground responses in actual event data.
- Reduce hallucinations.
- Improve answer relevance.
- Provide dynamic answers when event data changes.
- Separate application knowledge from the LLM's pretrained knowledge.

